Cell["\<\
In the above block I should: 
- remove any piece of code whose is purpose is to enforce that rp be a root \
of Delta\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978673984032072*^9, 
  3.978674015381754*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ff378d79-4748-ae49-88cd-\
dc742ea01e2e"],

Cell["\<\
We first introduce F10 and F20, which are the functions that appear in the \
radial ODE. Since this piece of code is solely interested in expanding the \
solution near the event horizon, we  introduce F1=F10*(r-rp) and \
F2=F20*(r-rp)^2, which are the functions we will ultimately feed to the \
HorizonExpansion block.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9785918185407104`*^9, 3.9785919187101116`*^9}, {
  3.978592513923485*^9, 
  3.9785925254078712`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ff19ddd9-a7f9-a44e-a758-\
374a54c8cb3a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"kthCoefficientinfinity", "[", 
  RowBox[{"F1exp", ",", " ", "r", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]], "Code",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.978522278887084*^9, 3.9785223112571907`*^9}, {
